Type: Project
Package: reefrestorationtool
Title: Reef Restoration Prioritisation Tool
Version: 2.5.1
Description: R Shiny decision-support tool that converts routine coral reef
    transect data into relative restoration priorities (Feasibility, Urgency,
    management classes, donor shortlist) with bootstrap uncertainty and
    weight-sensitivity checks. This file lists dependencies for renv; the
    project is not an installable package.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Depends: R (>= 4.3)
Imports: shiny, ggplot2
Suggests: ggrepel, rstudioapi, testthat
Encoding: UTF-8
